{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-2","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：连比例与比例与整数","englishTitle":"To find numbers in continued proportion, as many as may be prescribed, and the least that are in a given ratio.","book":8,"number":2,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.2","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.2/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":2,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","contentId":"euclid-8-2","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6321dfa3e01d190d3b9df60bbec28575883a54591031b8e7a1052f65a2611b94","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-2.statement","euclid-8-2.construction.1","euclid-8-2.construction.2","euclid-8-2.proof.1","euclid-8-2.proof.2","euclid-8-2.proof.3","euclid-8-2.proof.4","euclid-8-2.proof.5","euclid-8-2.proof.6","euclid-8-2.proof.7","euclid-8-2.proof.8","euclid-8-2.proof.9","euclid-8-2.proof.10","euclid-8-2.proof.11","euclid-8-2.proof.12","euclid-8-2.proof.13","euclid-8-2.proof.14","euclid-8-2.proof.15","euclid-8-2.proof.16","euclid-8-2.proof.17","euclid-8-2.proof.18","euclid-8-2.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-2.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89c6ae1b3c6a372946030a84b96ed1f28338a3165ae9b5d34ca9103e9f86ad45","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find numbers in continued proportion, as many as may be prescribed, and the least that are in a given ratio."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"给定一个比例和所需的项数，求满足该连比例关系的一组最小正整数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bd1eff54e14595c4c2040c0d91ec17a8e9173bbf66c40e921fda5db7bda956ce","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the ratio of A to B be the given ratio in least numbers; thus it is required to find numbers in continued proportion, as many as may be prescribed, and the least that are in the ratio of A to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A比B的比例应最低;因此,需要确定连比例,按规定人数,最少A比B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e70d4ba1c669cdd8524e328b18fd433a3c920a13534101cd6b6fcfd75cecf31","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let four be prescribed; let A by multiplying itself make C, and by multiplying B let it make D; let B by multiplying itself make E; further, let A by multiplying C, D, E make F, G, H, and let B by multiplying E make K."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"4个是规定的;A是乘以本身的C,B是乘以D;B是乘以本身的E;A是乘以C、D、E是乘以F、G、H是H,B和E是K产品。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"09911478c764b249692b848bfd4aaa16d135a81e7e9a65af1bbe64cf544c445d","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since A by multiplying itself has made C, and by multiplying B has made D, therefore, as A is to B, so is C to D. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,A乘以本身就已经达到C,B乘以B,D,A比B等于C比D；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"544fb7f924f52120f11820f817e3728a9dc84e80f11737308d33f82fe54bfa6c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since A by multiplying B has made D, and B by multiplying itself has made E, therefore the numbers A, B by multiplying B have made the numbers D, E respectively."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"再来从A到B乘以D、B乘以乘以E 已经达到E因此,数字A,B乘以B, 使数字分别为D,E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9bcdda38c91290d1016e6b33e68de920469e70bbd4dffcd67bed680355fe3054","citations":["euclid-7-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as A is to B, so is D to E. [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比B等于D比E；A 与 B 之比等于 D 与 E 之比。 [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"194aea73f148d91a8cf261bb45cddd36f12c6b1207dbbb9e628f6ecec2aa3dbe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as A is to B, so is C to D; therefore also, as C is to D, so is D to E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,A对B的比等于C对D的比;因此,C对D的比等于D对E的比；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比；C 与 D 之比等于 D 与 E 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"28627e38c40ff34426d74b83f73fc01efb7d4943e6ee8584299a13ecd96209e4","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since A by multiplying C, D has made F, G, therefore, as C is to D, so is F to G. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A乘以C,D 使F,G,C比D等于F比G；C 与 D 之比等于 F 与 G 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b21e188f1936cf76c7e58610d9e3292d95c70c95002d225c64ebcdd9ef8c874c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as C is to D, so was A to B; therefore also, as A is to B, so is F to G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,C为D,A为B;因此,A为B,即F为G；C 与 D 之比等于 A 与 B 之比；A 与 B 之比等于 F 与 G 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"df0f3add23fa1a4234eb7e170fb18593819c054d45dcfce2573f301b0f3489e6","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since A by multiplying D, E has made G, H, therefore, as D is to E, so is G to H. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自A乘以D以来,E已使G,H,D与E的比等于G与H的比；D 与 E 之比等于 G 与 H 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ff0da442498940572a9b1a868d4552fae1a80f78d58a811193f5cffef556615","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as D is to E, so is A to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,D比E的比等于A比B；D 与 E 之比等于 A 与 B 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"34c226a619d7026b4c3ebd8937eba62b10b69c4960abfb95839c4b166d15c164","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as A is to B, so is G to H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比B的比例也等于G比H；A 与 B 之比等于 G 与 H 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6a9be4453b10618a6c71133037b559e62447375273863a3f9122a9977b580eb","citations":["euclid-7-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since A, B by multiplying E have made H, K, therefore, as A is to B, so is H to K. [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自A,B乘以E H,K,A比B等于H比K；A 与 B 之比等于 H 与 K 之比。 [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"77b7cd79bbae451a0dbb2790b3bd2d983ab00355a22ffc57cb6e13408b0447d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as A is to B, so is F to G, and G to H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,A对B的比等于F对G和G对H的比；A 与 B 之比等于 F 与 G 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0447a0805aefcdcd49a9964c37af1bdb2d1f4b1c784a21bd30033a897259235c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as F is to G, so is G to H, and H to K; therefore C, D, E, and F, G, H, K are proportional in the ratio of A to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,F对G的比相当于G对H和H对K的比;因此,C、D、E和F、G、H、K和F的比是A对B；F 与 G 之比等于 G 与 H 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4c46ddacc3727a7ebf920685446b92370fc73c5fe485b9caa9a225e1fc2fe055","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that they are the least numbers that are so."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来要说,它们是最不计数字的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"258e5bd08fb365093c83ffe92045b1395d3b9502d6069076c6ab649289f37b88","citations":["euclid-7-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A, B are the least of those which have the same ratio with them, and the least of those which have the same ratio are prime to one another, [[VII. 22](/principles/euclid-7-22)] therefore A, B are prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,A中,B最少,而与它们相同比例的人最少,互素,因此A,B最少,互素。 [[VII. 22](/principles/euclid-7-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"568247812efccf543c59a7e9990a89bb51fc5d4a2286d5fefe8001818fbdf764","citations":["euclid-7-27"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the numbers A, B by multiplying themselves respectively have made the numbers C, E, and by multiplying the numbers C, E respectively have made the numbers F, K; therefore C, E and F, K are prime to one another respectively. [[VII. 27](/principles/euclid-7-27)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B乘以本身, 使C,E, 乘以C,E, F,K,因此,C,E和F,K,分别是互素。 [[VII. 27](/principles/euclid-7-27)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4c2e92de2bad052214cd228d15d81f2a4f6895c252a5eb3a39fb81a324cba7a6","citations":["euclid-8-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if there be as many numbers as we please in continued proportion, and the extremes of them be prime to one another, they are the least of those which have the same ratio with them. [[VIII. 1](/principles/euclid-8-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果连比例个中我们想得到多少数字,而且其中最极端的数字是互素个,那么,它们与它们的比例最小。 [[VIII. 1](/principles/euclid-8-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"136dd497e28bd440986d2cb47f93355d9e6c7f98b7d52228765e4a3f46dd1552","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore C, D, E and F, G, H, K are the least of those which have the same ratio with A, B. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C、D、E和F、G、H、K是A、B、Q、D和D之间相同比中最少的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb45f1f4c3bd46be3e2a3ef227dbbd29187a9f95734c9638b1658f1e9fd22b12","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. From this it is manifest that, if three numbers in continued proportion be the least of those which have the same ratio with them, the extremes of them are squares, and, if four numbers, cubes."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"推论,从这一点来看,很明显,如果连比例的3个数字是与其相同比例的最小数字,那么其中最极端的数字是平方数,如果是4个数字,则是立方体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-2.source","contentId":"euclid-8-2","revisionId":"euclid-8-2@raw-6321dfa3e01d190d","order":21,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9bb46e9a7a89aab11ef2010b1b598586510fd8d9bb58f5b4c9a4bc32d40475c8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.2/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.2\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-8-2:euclid-7-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-2.proof.1","euclid-8-2.proof.5","euclid-8-2.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"VII. 17"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-2:euclid-7-18:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-2.proof.3","euclid-8-2.proof.10"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-18","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"VII. 18"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-2:euclid-7-22:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-2.proof.14"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-22","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"VII. 22"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-2:euclid-7-27:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-2.proof.15"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-27","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.pers